WEBVTT

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:36.870 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.900 line:0%
[Episode 28]

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.480 line:0%
Lord Yan.

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:43.440 line:0%
So is there really no way

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:45.720 line:0%
to bring the dead back to life?

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:53.550 line:0%
There's too much injustice in this world,

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:55.570 line:0%
especially towards women.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.320 line:0%
A woman has to obey her father at home,

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.120 line:0%
and obey her husband after getting married.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:02.450 line:0%
All those rules of obedience and virtues.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:04.000 line:0%
If a woman made the slightest mistake,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.790 line:0%
she'd be despised by others,

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.240 line:0%
and she'd be

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:08.640 line:0%
drowned in spit.

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:10.260 line:0%
Just think about it.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:13.400 line:0%
How ironic is this?

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:19.360 line:0%
But if people only cling to these rules,

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:20.879 line:0%
how can we ever achieve

00:02:20.879 --> 00:02:22.000 line:0%
true equality?

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:28.040 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:31.640 line:0%
How did you come to know Lord Mo?

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.680 line:0%
And why do you call him Brother Mo?

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:36.360 line:0%
He once saved me.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:37.920 line:0%
However,

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:40.160 line:0%
perhaps at that time,

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:40.800 line:0%
he had already

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.360 line:0%
chosen me as a sacrifice.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:46.920 line:0%
You truly do resemble Mo Xiuxiu

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.680 line:0%
to some extent.

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.160 line:0%
But I'm

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.240 line:0%
ultimately not Mo Xiuxiu.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:22.800 line:0%
Stop right there!

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:23.560 line:0%
Don't move!

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.000 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:41.960 line:0%
What's this about?

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.310 line:0%
Release Lord Mo!

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.830 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi colluded with the Fire Moth Cult,

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.129 line:0%
abused his power, and killed innocent people.

00:03:48.129 --> 00:03:50.240 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau is here on imperial orders to arrest him.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:51.160 line:0%
Nonsense!

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.360 line:0%
Lord Mo has been protecting the people

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:55.440 line:0%
and fighting fiercely against the Half-faced Ghosts.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:57.520 line:0%
Back when he was executing the criminal Ji Dafu,

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:59.760 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, you repeatedly obstructed him.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:02.320 line:0%
It's not hard to see that you have ulterior motives.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:03.480 line:0%
Therefore, Lord Mo ordered us

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:04.540 line:0%
to be on high alert.

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:05.680 line:0%
Sure enough,

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:07.240 line:0%
we've discovered that your group

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:08.500 line:0%
[To Guangchun Hall]

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.040 line:0%
has been secretly trading with the Half-faced Ghosts.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:09.600 line:0%
And now,

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.400 line:0%
you're even kidnapping Lord Mo.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.000 line:0%
Are you trying to turn the tables on us?

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.080 line:0%
You're framing us!

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:16.069 line:0%
Ever Since Grand Commander Shen arrived in Yingzhou City,

00:04:16.069 --> 00:04:18.040 line:0%
the Half-faced Ghosts have been popping up like bamboo shoots

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.400 line:0%
after a spring rain, one after another.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.350 line:0%
Could this also be a coincidence?

00:04:21.629 --> 00:04:23.040 line:0%
You're incredibly stupid.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:23.640 line:0%
You've all been

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:25.500 line:0%
fooled by Mo Qianzhi's disguise!

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.180 line:0%
Who exactly captured you?

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:28.640 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:30.320 line:0%
Come on, tell them the truth.

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:32.160 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi is the one colluding with the Half-faced Ghosts

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:32.800 line:0%
and wanting to use you

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:33.800 line:0%
as sacrifices.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:42.680 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:44.760 line:0%
It's been years since we last met.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:45.360 line:0%
I never expected

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:47.320 line:0%
you'd become like this.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:48.640 line:0%
Surrender now!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:49.640 line:0%
You corrupt official!

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.300 line:0%
Release Lord Mo immediately!

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:53.560 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi is the one who condoned the Half-faced Ghosts

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.440 line:0%
committing atrocities in the city.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.000 line:0%
He took advantage of

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.320 line:0%
all your trust!

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:58.120 line:0%
White Ghost!

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.480 line:0%
Release Lord Mo at once!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:00.240 line:0%
Governor Mo is a

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:01.800 line:0%
good official who cares for the people.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:03.600 line:0%
He always has the people's interests at heart.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:05.350 line:0%
Don't you frame him!

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:06.440 line:0%
Release Lord Mo!

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:08.140 line:0%
Release Lord Mo!

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.380 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.860 line:0%
Step back! Step back!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:12.420 line:0%
Don't harm the civilians!

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.480 line:0%
We can't fight them,

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:17.000 line:0%
and we can't reason with them.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:17.840 line:0%
These people of Yingzhou

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:18.800 line:0%
have all gone mad.

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:19.670 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.360 line:0%
They've seen clearly

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.920 line:0%
who's human and who's ghost.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:23.780 line:0%
What about you?

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.110 line:0%
So this was your plan all along.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:29.440 line:0%
Wait!

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:33.840 line:0%
Stop!

00:05:35.959 --> 00:05:36.980 line:0%
Sun Tan.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.200 line:0%
Are you constables trying to rebel?

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.740 line:0%
My apologies, Lord Mo.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.300 line:0%
You all know

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:44.200 line:0%
how tough we constables can be.

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:46.020 line:0%
Everyone, step back! Step back!

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:51.440 line:0%
Let them go!

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:24.020 line:0%
Hurry, go! Let's go!

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.720 line:0%
Thank you, General Sun, for coming to our rescue today.

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:36.160 line:0%
Don't mention it, Grand Commander.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.520 line:0%
Commander Xu has sent me a letter,

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.240 line:0%
ordering me to assist Secretary Yan with the investigation.

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:41.000 line:0%
It was only natural for me to come and save you.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.120 line:0%
If it weren't for the constables' help today,

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:44.000 line:0%
the people in the city,

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.260 line:0%
with their spit alone,

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.000 line:0%
would have drowned us.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.560 line:0%
For the people of Yingzhou,

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:49.880 line:0%
Governor Mo is

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.200 line:0%
a remarkable official.

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.720 line:0%
During famine years, he set up porridge stalls

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.440 line:0%
and distributed free porridge to the people.

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:56.000 line:0%
On ordinary days, he led the yamen runners

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:57.730 line:0%
to repair houses for the people

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:59.220 line:0%
without charging a penny.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.630 line:0%
How could the common people

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:01.600 line:0%
possibly think of such an official

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.680 line:0%
as a bad person?

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:04.600 line:0%
On one side, he's a benevolent person beloved by the people

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.460 line:0%
and respected by his colleagues,

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:08.400 line:0%
while on the other, he's a madman who disregards human life

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.040 line:0%
and believes in a cult.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:11.770 line:0%
With these two sides of him,

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:15.500 line:0%
it's indeed hard to distinguish.

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:19.940 line:0%
For now, we can only hide outside the city

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:21.610 line:0%
and wait to see what happens.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.000 line:0%
I'm sorry for the trouble

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.400 line:0%
we brought to fellow constables,

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.360 line:0%
having to be displaced here with us.

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:28.480 line:0%
You're the people Commander Xu trusts.

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.440 line:0%
I, the leader of constables

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.600 line:0%
in Gannan Area,

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:31.490 line:0%
trust you.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:37.240 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:38.640 line:0%
We just received a confidential letter.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:39.770 line:0%
It's from Xiang'an.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.400 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has ordered

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.880 line:0%
the troops from surrounding counties to gather.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:51.740 line:0%
She wants me and General Zhenyuan

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.530 line:0%
to capture Mo Qianzhi alive together.

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:54.520 line:0%
But Mo Qianzhi just sent people

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:55.640 line:0%
to drive us out of the city.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:58.570 line:0%
This confidential letter arrived a bit too quickly.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.170 line:0%
Before coming here,

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:04.400 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager summoned me,

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:06.680 line:0%
ordering me to keep a close eye on Mo Qianzhi.

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:08.120 line:0%
After I arrived in Yingzhou City,

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.380 line:0%
a secret agent once made contact with me.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:11.880 line:0%
It was probably

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.610 line:0%
Bi Qiu who was killed recently.

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:15.080 line:0%
It's very likely

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.770 line:0%
that he sensed something unusual

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:19.120 line:0%
and sent the news to Xiang'an early on.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:21.020 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:22.320 line:0%
it seems that everyone,

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:23.530 line:0%
both inside and outside of the Cang State,

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.280 line:0%
is under

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:26.740 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager's surveillance.

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:28.680 line:0%
This shows that

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:30.240 line:0%
sending me to Gannan Area

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.320 line:0%
to deal with the Half-faced Ghost incident

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.440 line:0%
was also part of

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:34.380 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager's calculations.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.280 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.800 line:0%
ordered you to capture Yingzhou City.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:37.830 line:0%
If there's going to be a battle,

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.359 line:0%
what will happen to the civilians in the city?

00:08:41.719 --> 00:08:43.650 line:0%
I hope there will be a turn of events

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:46.770 line:0%
before General Zhenyuan arrives.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.200 line:0%
Who's there?

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:51.880 line:0%
Who is it?

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:52.880 line:0%
Come out!

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.190 line:0%
Qi Yeyun?

00:08:58.400 --> 00:08:59.480 line:0%
Sneaking around like that.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:02.000 line:0%
You just wanted to be dragged over here, didn't you?

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.450 line:0%
This is what my sister taught me.

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:05.220 line:0%
Always observe clearly first.

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:07.060 line:0%
Caution is the parent of safety.

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:16.050 line:0%
I, Shen Du, am here.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.580 line:0%
I have something to say to Mo Qianzhi.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.150 line:0%
If you want to talk,

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.630 line:0%
come up and speak!

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:17.430 line:0%
You really dare to come alone.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:19.920 line:0%
Aren't you afraid I'll kill you?

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:23.600 line:0%
I'm here to give you

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:24.480 line:0%
an ultimatum.

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:29.240 line:0%
Xiang'an already learned about your betrayal.

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:30.640 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has dispatched the Zhenyuan Army

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:31.980 line:0%
to send troops to Yingzhou.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:34.060 line:0%
It's not too late to back down now.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:36.990 line:0%
If they want to attack the city,

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:38.480 line:0%
it won't be as easy

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:39.360 line:0%
as they think.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:46.930 line:0%
Do you think

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:48.880 line:0%
with the tens of thousands of citizens in the city

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:49.760 line:0%
following you,

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:52.440 line:0%
along with those few Half-faced Ghosts,

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.370 line:0%
you can stand against the imperial court?

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:55.790 line:0%
The will of the people

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.800 line:0%
is worth ten thousand troops.

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:04.160 line:0%
Do you still remember

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:07.220 line:0%
the oath you took when you became my father's disciple?

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:10.790 line:0%
To serve the country with utmost loyalty,

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:14.770 line:0%
and to be worthy of the trust of all the common people under heaven.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:25.600 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:27.840 line:0%
I really never thought

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:30.300 line:0%
that one day, you would say such things to me.

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:33.240 line:0%
Can't you see

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:34.600 line:0%
that the current Cang State

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:36.280 line:0%
is already crawling with parasites?

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:38.880 line:0%
Its decay and collapse is only a matter of time.

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:45.060 line:0%
Then remove these parasites,

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.170 line:0%
instead of tearing it down.

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:53.880 line:0%
The people of the Fire Moth Sect

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:55.140 line:0%
have always disregarded human life

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:57.070 line:0%
and could betray you at any moment.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:57.960 line:0%
Are you really going to use

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:00.090 line:0%
the lives of these innocent civilians

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:01.930 line:0%
to take this gamble?

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:11.600 line:0%
If you want to negotiate,

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:12.400 line:0%
we can.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.770 line:0%
Agree to one condition of mine.

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:15.770 line:0%
What condition?

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.250 line:0%
Bring Mrs. Shen's

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:23.590 line:0%
head to me, and then we'll talk.

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:37.600 line:0%
There's no room for negotiation then.

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:39.360 line:0%
Du.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.010 line:0%
She works for the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:43.880 line:0%
She's the Grand Empress Dowager's

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:45.590 line:0%
tool to control you.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:46.640 line:0%
Without her,

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.520 line:0%
you'll come to your senses

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:50.160 line:0%
and see how devastated

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.960 line:0%
the Cang State is now.

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:53.600 line:0%
The one blinded by hatred

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:54.360 line:0%
is you.

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:56.780 line:0%
This time,

00:12:58.180 --> 00:12:59.740 line:0%
you're really wrong.

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:12.760 line:0%
I'm wrong?

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.570 line:0%
You clasped an enemy to your bosom.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:21.520 line:0%
Oh right,

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.600 line:0%
she's the one with bosom.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.880 line:0%
What she eats every day

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:29.800 line:0%
is delicacies stained red with the blood

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:30.960 line:0%
of your people.

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:32.280 line:0%
What she enjoys

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:34.640 line:0%
is the wealth and glory built upon the bones

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:35.760 line:0%
of your people.

00:13:38.240 --> 00:13:39.160 line:0%
If I'm wrong,

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:43.220 line:0%
aren't you even more mistaken?

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:49.060 line:0%
Don't you want to know the truth?

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.390 line:0%
[Granary of Xiang'an, Cang State]

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:55.980 line:0%
[Granary of Xiang'an, Cang State]

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:00.070 line:0%
This is a sack for storing grain and fodder.

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:05.350 line:0%
[Granary of Xiang'an, Cang State]

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:01.400 line:0%
Why did the grain and fodder stamped with

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.480 line:0%
the granary seal from back then

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:04.160 line:0%
end up

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:07.250 line:0%
in Gannan Area, which is a thousand miles away from Xiang'an?

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.110 line:0%
[Granary of Xiang'an, Cang State]

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.080 line:0%
Shouldn't these have been

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.120 line:0%
destroyed by

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.640 line:0%
the great fire back then?

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.080 line:0%
Have you ever considered

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:15.170 line:0%
that back then, my teacher,

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:16.760 line:0%
your father,

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:18.360 line:0%
was actually guarding

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:19.160 line:0%
what was already

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:20.940 line:0%
an emptied treasury?

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:28.790 line:0%
I will uncover the truth myself.

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:32.200 line:0%
But if you're to gamble with

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:34.330 line:0%
the lives of the civilians of the city,

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:35.720 line:0%
and to risk massacring an entire city

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.650 line:0%
to establish your own foundation,

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:39.860 line:0%
I cannot agree with that.

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:43.460 line:0%
[Granary of Xiang'an, Cang State]

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.540 line:0%
Stop this while you still can.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:50.040 line:0%
I don't have many people left in the world

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.520 line:0%
that I'm close to.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.370 line:0%
[Granary of Xiang'an, Cang State]

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:03.290 line:0%
[Granary of Xiang'an, Cang State]

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:01.960 line:0%
I don't need your agreement.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:06.880 line:0%
The arrow is on the string and must be released.

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:09.620 line:0%
I've been planning and enduring for so long.

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:11.510 line:0%
I won't fail at the last moment.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.140 line:0%
I remember

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:24.090 line:0%
you said you wanted revenge, didn't you?

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:27.640 line:0%
Of course I want revenge,

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:31.550 line:0%
but my father

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.200 line:0%
and I

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:37.880 line:0%
would never use

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:40.810 line:0%
the lives of all the citizens in the city for revenge!

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.320 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:14.200 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:17.090 line:0%
How did the negotiation go?

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:22.740 line:0%
There's no room for negotiation.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:24.720 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:16:25.240 --> 00:16:26.440 line:0%
Where is General Zhenyuan now?

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:27.720 line:0%
We've received word from neighboring Mengzhou.

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.360 line:0%
The reinforcements should arrive in about three days.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:31.200 line:0%
This Mo Qianzhi.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:32.760 line:0%
Who knows how many troops he has amassed?

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:33.720 line:0%
If it comes to that,

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.360 line:0%
and all the male citizens in the city come to defend it,

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:37.000 line:0%
it will surely be a fierce battle.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.000 line:0%
Not necessarily!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.490 line:0%
Mr. Pan, you're indeed efficient.

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:44.420 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.520 line:0%
I've brought all the items

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:46.440 line:0%
you requested.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.360 line:0%
What are these?

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:54.090 line:0%
What do you need these bamboo poles for?

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:56.920 line:0%
A risky military strategy.

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:59.280 line:0%
Success or failure hinges on this move.

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:18.750 line:0%
[Cang]

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:21.879 line:0%
[Cang]

00:17:26.659 --> 00:17:28.180 line:0%
You're not planning to

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.260 line:0%
occupy Yingzhou City

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.840 line:0%
before General Zhenyuan arrives, are you?

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:07.630 line:0%
Brother Mo.

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:11.290 line:0%
People often say

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:13.180 line:0%
let bygones

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:15.480 line:0%
be bygones.

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:23.650 line:0%
But some pain

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.220 line:0%
doesn't just exist in memory.

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:30.660 line:0%
It's already deeply embedded in our flesh and blood.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.400 line:0%
It vibrates

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:35.460 line:0%
with every breath,

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:39.420 line:0%
constantly destroying

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.200 line:0%
and cursing,

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:46.010 line:0%
asking why I haven't died yet.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:07.160 line:0%
And those

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.000 line:0%
who haven't truly experienced it,

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.530 line:0%
how could they understand?

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:12.440 line:0%
What right do they have to teach others

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:13.360 line:0%
how to live?

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:16.630 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.040 line:0%
Do you think

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:22.680 line:0%
I was wrong?

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:26.450 line:0%
You're a good official

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:28.830 line:0%
and a good brother.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:30.920 line:0%
You're the best person

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:32.360 line:0%
I've ever met.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:36.080 line:0%
You're the one who

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:37.940 line:0%
saved me from the pile of corpses.

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:40.250 line:0%
Not only did you save me,

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:43.080 line:0%
but you've also helped Yingzhou City a lot.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.560 line:0%
You haven't let anyone down.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:48.680 line:0%
It's this world

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:50.480 line:0%
that owes you too much.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.420 line:0%
You're just like her,

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.930 line:0%
always trusting me unconditionally.

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:03.920 line:0%
But I've let you both down.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:09.960 line:0%
If one day

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:11.620 line:0%
she really comes back to life,

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.250 line:0%
I'm afraid she wouldn't recognize

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:16.800 line:0%
what her brother

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:17.720 line:0%
has become now.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:26.160 line:0%
If possible,

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.100 line:0%
I'd really like to know

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:30.880 line:0%
what the old you

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.960 line:0%
was like.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:53.240 line:0%
[Yingzhou City]

00:20:57.630 --> 00:20:58.420 line:0%
[Yingzhou City]

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:13.070 line:0%
Listen up, those above!

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:16.230 line:0%
[Yingzhou City]

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:15.240 line:0%
General Zhenyuan has led an army of 100,000 men here,

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:16.760 line:0%
and they've reached the outskirts of the city.

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:18.140 line:0%
They're here to protect the citizens

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:19.470 line:0%
and wipe out the rebels.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:22.170 line:0%
This is the last chance for Yingzhou City.

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:23.280 line:0%
Surrender, and your lives will be spared!

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:25.470 line:0%
[Yingzhou City]

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:25.640 line:0%
If you remain obstinate,

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:27.860 line:0%
the traitors will be executed

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:30.450 line:0%
to safeguard our people!

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:32.380 line:0%
Lord Mo!

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:34.960 line:0%
Lord Mo.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:36.640 line:0%
If war can be avoided,

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:38.120 line:0%
I hope you can spare the lives of the citizens

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:39.570 line:0%
in this city.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.080 line:0%
The current situation

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.760 line:0%
is far beyond our expectations.

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:44.020 line:0%
I've heard that General Zhenyuan

00:21:44.020 --> 00:21:45.920 line:0%
is cruel and belligerent by nature.

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:47.720 line:0%
With the addition of these 100,000 reinforcements,

00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:48.800 line:0%
Yingzhou

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:50.670 line:0%
will surely be destroyed in an instant today.

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:53.270 line:0%
It will be a catastrophe for all living beings.

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:09.200 line:0%
Indecisive.

00:22:09.370 --> 00:22:11.170 line:0%
Unlikely to achieve greatness!

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:12.120 line:0%
Lord Mo.

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:14.690 line:0%
My lord asked me to relay a message to you.

00:22:15.240 --> 00:22:16.520 line:0%
Now is the crucial moment to

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:17.720 line:0%
change allegiances.

00:22:17.930 --> 00:22:18.890 line:0%
You must not

00:22:19.630 --> 00:22:21.060 line:0%
show womanly kindness.

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:22.720 line:0%
The people of Fire Moth Sect

00:22:22.720 --> 00:22:24.080 line:0%
have always been ruthless with lives.

00:22:24.080 --> 00:22:26.080 line:0%
They might betray you at any moment.

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:26.800 line:0%
Are you really going to gamble with

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:28.560 line:0%
the lives of these

00:22:29.510 --> 00:22:30.880 line:0%
innocent civilians?

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:35.920 line:0%
Lord Mo, for Yingzhou and its people,

00:22:35.920 --> 00:22:36.920 line:0%
would be willing to lay down his life,

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:38.360 line:0%
yet he fell victim to the schemes of evil men.

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:39.920 line:0%
We must protect Lord Mo

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:41.120 line:0%
and protect Yingzhou City!

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:42.480 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:22:42.560 --> 00:22:43.920 line:0%
Protect Yingzhou City!

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:45.360 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:46.800 line:0%
Protect Yingzhou City!

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:48.320 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:49.920 line:0%
Protect Yingzhou City!

00:22:50.040 --> 00:22:51.560 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:22:51.600 --> 00:22:53.130 line:0%
Protect Yingzhou City!

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:54.560 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:22:54.560 --> 00:22:55.880 line:0%
You are a good official

00:22:56.360 --> 00:22:57.810 line:0%
and a good brother.

00:22:58.490 --> 00:22:59.400 line:0%
You're the best person

00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:00.880 line:0%
I've ever met.

00:23:01.800 --> 00:23:02.740 line:0%
In the end,

00:23:03.300 --> 00:23:05.320 line:0%
I've failed Yingzhou.

00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:07.590 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:23:07.680 --> 00:23:09.280 line:0%
Protect Yingzhou City!

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:10.880 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:12.440 line:0%
Protect Yingzhou City!

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:14.080 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:23:14.320 --> 00:23:16.180 line:0%
Protect Yingzhou City!

00:23:17.430 --> 00:23:18.930 line:0%
[Yingzhou City]

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:19.020 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:23:19.760 --> 00:23:21.000 line:0%
I, Mo Qianzhi,

00:23:21.160 --> 00:23:22.740 line:0%
challenge you to a duel!

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:40.290 line:0%
We've finally come to this.

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:49.510 line:0%
[Yingzhou City]

00:24:09.150 --> 00:24:10.200 line:0%
I taught you martial arts

00:24:10.200 --> 00:24:11.320 line:0%
when you were little.

00:24:11.320 --> 00:24:12.120 line:0%
In the past,

00:24:12.160 --> 00:24:13.490 line:0%
you've never beaten me.

00:24:18.890 --> 00:24:20.030 line:0%
You learned the move

00:24:20.160 --> 00:24:21.200 line:0%
I just taught you quite quickly.

00:24:21.200 --> 00:24:22.270 line:0%
Study diligently and practice earnestly,

00:24:22.270 --> 00:24:23.720 line:0%
only then can one make rapid progress.

00:24:23.720 --> 00:24:24.520 line:0%
One day,

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:25.680 line:0%
I'll be able to defeat you.

00:24:25.680 --> 00:24:27.210 line:0%
Then you'd better hurry up.

00:24:27.400 --> 00:24:28.400 line:0%
I'm determined to become

00:24:28.400 --> 00:24:29.800 line:0%
the top military general of the Cang State,

00:24:29.800 --> 00:24:30.920 line:0%
galloping across battlefields

00:24:30.920 --> 00:24:32.720 line:0%
and serving the country with loyalty.

00:24:32.720 --> 00:24:33.520 line:0%
This time,

00:24:34.990 --> 00:24:36.330 line:0%
it's my turn to win.

00:24:42.590 --> 00:24:43.590 line:0%
What should we do?

00:25:37.160 --> 00:25:37.960 line:0%
Senior.

00:25:39.240 --> 00:25:40.570 line:0%
I'm indeed getting old.

00:25:40.720 --> 00:25:42.920 line:0%
My reflexes can't match yours anymore.

00:25:56.440 --> 00:25:58.020 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:25:58.040 --> 00:25:59.480 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:25:59.510 --> 00:26:01.200 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:26:01.230 --> 00:26:02.720 line:0%
Protect Lord Mo!

00:26:12.720 --> 00:26:13.650 line:0%
You came to fight

00:26:14.680 --> 00:26:15.480 line:0%
because you couldn't bear to see

00:26:15.480 --> 00:26:18.280 line:0%
these people of Yingzhou lose their lives, right?

00:26:35.800 --> 00:26:36.890 line:0%
Open the city gate!

00:26:36.920 --> 00:26:38.040 line:0%
No need to fight anymore! Great!

00:26:38.040 --> 00:26:39.960 line:0%
No need to fight anymore! Great!

00:27:30.210 --> 00:27:33.650 line:0%
[Cang]

00:27:41.070 --> 00:27:44.150 line:0%
What an impressive bluff.

00:27:44.920 --> 00:27:45.720 line:0%
Du.

00:27:46.600 --> 00:27:47.600 line:0%
Over these years,

00:27:47.840 --> 00:27:49.510 line:0%
you've indeed improved.

00:27:59.500 --> 00:28:01.370 line:0%
[Cang]

00:28:23.460 --> 00:28:25.270 line:0%
[Cang]

00:28:26.630 --> 00:28:27.750 line:0%
You've won.

00:28:28.570 --> 00:28:30.900 line:0%
If you had been a dispassionate observer,

00:28:31.770 --> 00:28:33.970 line:0%
you might have seen through this trick.

00:28:35.960 --> 00:28:36.760 line:0%
I was betting

00:28:37.480 --> 00:28:38.280 line:0%
that you wouldn't dare to risk

00:28:38.280 --> 00:28:40.480 line:0%
the lives of all the people in Yingzhou.

00:28:41.960 --> 00:28:42.760 line:0%
So,

00:28:43.960 --> 00:28:45.360 line:0%
you haven't really lost.

00:28:46.840 --> 00:28:48.970 line:0%
When will the reinforcements arrive?

00:28:49.040 --> 00:28:49.840 line:0%
Tomorrow.

00:28:50.360 --> 00:28:51.820 line:0%
Then when that time comes,

00:28:51.840 --> 00:28:53.440 line:0%
how will you explain to them?

00:28:55.800 --> 00:28:57.440 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi was controlled by a cult

00:28:57.440 --> 00:28:59.040 line:0%
and overestimated himself.

00:29:00.680 --> 00:29:02.810 line:0%
Yingzhou's military forces were scarce

00:29:02.810 --> 00:29:04.610 line:0%
and couldn't withstand a fight.

00:29:18.170 --> 00:29:20.520 line:0%
There are still many civilians in the city,

00:29:20.520 --> 00:29:21.600 line:0%
who believe that you are being

00:29:21.600 --> 00:29:22.920 line:0%
manipulated by the Fire Moth Sect,

00:29:22.920 --> 00:29:24.850 line:0%
pleading for mercy on your behalf.

00:29:28.200 --> 00:29:29.000 line:0%
Tell me,

00:29:29.760 --> 00:29:30.880 line:0%
how do you and the leader of the Fire Moth Sect

00:29:30.880 --> 00:29:32.160 line:0%
communicate?

00:29:50.490 --> 00:29:52.720 line:0%
People laugh at moths flying into the fire.

00:29:52.720 --> 00:29:54.720 line:0%
Moths go through fire and don't die;

00:29:54.800 --> 00:29:56.400 line:0%
they are reborn in the cycle.

00:30:09.520 --> 00:30:12.210 line:0%
The idea of resurrection is inherently a fallacy.

00:30:12.210 --> 00:30:13.870 line:0%
Heaven has the virtue of cherishing life.

00:30:13.870 --> 00:30:15.400 line:0%
Even mayflies that live for just a day

00:30:15.400 --> 00:30:16.040 line:0%
have their place

00:30:16.040 --> 00:30:17.700 line:0%
on the path of reincarnation.

00:30:17.880 --> 00:30:19.880 line:0%
How could they possibly not enter the cycle of reincarnation?

00:30:19.880 --> 00:30:21.920 line:0%
Moths flying through fire will only turn to ashes.

00:30:21.920 --> 00:30:23.590 line:0%
If they're unable to enter the cycle of reincarnation,

00:30:23.590 --> 00:30:24.990 line:0%
how could they be reborn?

00:30:32.400 --> 00:30:33.460 line:0%
The person you saw,

00:30:35.290 --> 00:30:36.550 line:0%
could it be Chen Huo'e?

00:30:37.480 --> 00:30:38.760 line:0%
I told you early on

00:30:38.760 --> 00:30:40.000 line:0%
not to get involved.

00:30:40.620 --> 00:30:41.640 line:0%
You don't know how deep the waters are

00:30:41.640 --> 00:30:43.440 line:0%
and insist on going your own way.

00:30:43.640 --> 00:30:44.840 line:0%
In fact, I never reported

00:30:44.840 --> 00:30:46.570 line:0%
the incident of Half-faced Ghost causing trouble.

00:30:46.570 --> 00:30:48.440 line:0%
Someone used my name.

00:30:49.320 --> 00:30:50.720 line:0%
From the very beginning,

00:30:51.480 --> 00:30:53.410 line:0%
you fell into someone else's trap.

00:30:57.940 --> 00:30:59.600 line:0%
What is this person's motive?

00:31:04.880 --> 00:31:06.130 line:0%
Until we reach Xiang'an

00:31:06.130 --> 00:31:08.060 line:0%
and see the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:31:09.240 --> 00:31:10.720 line:0%
I won't say anything.

00:31:51.240 --> 00:31:52.120 line:0%
No matter what,

00:31:54.050 --> 00:31:55.380 line:0%
you are still my senior.

00:32:28.680 --> 00:32:29.760 line:0%
Lord Yan!

00:32:30.130 --> 00:32:31.360 line:0%
Lord Yan!

00:32:31.860 --> 00:32:33.030 line:0%
Lord Yan!

00:32:33.920 --> 00:32:34.680 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:32:34.680 --> 00:32:35.740 line:0%
Lord Yan.

00:32:36.400 --> 00:32:37.400 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:32:38.040 --> 00:32:39.670 line:0%
Must Mo Qianzhi die?

00:32:43.560 --> 00:32:44.720 line:0%
When we reach Xiang'an,

00:32:44.720 --> 00:32:47.850 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager will make the final decision.

00:32:48.800 --> 00:32:50.200 line:0%
It's such a long journey.

00:32:50.250 --> 00:32:51.920 line:0%
May I give him some food?

00:32:54.080 --> 00:32:54.880 line:0%
Rest assured.

00:32:55.000 --> 00:32:55.880 line:0%
We'll surely

00:32:55.880 --> 00:32:57.610 line:0%
take good care of him on the way.

00:32:58.120 --> 00:32:59.160 line:0%
No matter what,

00:32:59.840 --> 00:33:00.840 line:0%
my name

00:33:01.680 --> 00:33:03.240 line:0%
was given by Brother Mo.

00:33:04.940 --> 00:33:06.080 line:0%
You came here

00:33:06.560 --> 00:33:08.360 line:0%
not just for this matter, right?

00:33:11.530 --> 00:33:12.520 line:0%
I beg you.

00:33:15.240 --> 00:33:16.200 line:0%
Help me.

00:33:17.010 --> 00:33:18.440 line:0%
Please help me.

00:33:22.200 --> 00:33:23.200 line:0%
Jing Lin!

00:33:25.040 --> 00:33:26.470 line:0%
I want to see Mo Qianzhi!

00:33:28.540 --> 00:33:29.880 line:0%
I'm different from those other girls

00:33:29.880 --> 00:33:31.080 line:0%
who were sacrificed.

00:33:31.320 --> 00:33:32.080 line:0%
I've know

00:33:32.080 --> 00:33:34.010 line:0%
what Brother Mo was planning to do.

00:33:34.480 --> 00:33:36.000 line:0%
I am willing!

00:33:38.880 --> 00:33:39.680 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:33:41.640 --> 00:33:42.480 line:0%
Stop it.

00:33:44.880 --> 00:33:46.540 line:0%
You shouldn't have come here.

00:33:46.680 --> 00:33:47.480 line:0%
Go back.

00:33:50.480 --> 00:33:51.280 line:0%
Xing.

00:33:52.080 --> 00:33:53.340 line:0%
Don't come any closer!

00:34:00.240 --> 00:34:01.800 line:0%
I came here just to see you

00:34:02.720 --> 00:34:04.050 line:0%
and talk to you for a bit.

00:34:05.580 --> 00:34:06.640 line:0%
Come to think of it,

00:34:06.800 --> 00:34:08.510 line:0%
those days with you around

00:34:09.720 --> 00:34:10.680 line:0%
were the happiest and most joyful days

00:34:10.680 --> 00:34:12.680 line:0%
of my entire life, Brother Mo.

00:34:13.990 --> 00:34:15.760 line:0%
If it weren't for you, Brother Mo,

00:34:15.760 --> 00:34:17.700 line:0%
I'd have been dead for a long time.

00:34:47.769 --> 00:34:48.970 line:0%
[Xiu]

00:34:50.830 --> 00:34:52.800 line:0%
Thank you for giving me a name.

00:34:52.289 --> 00:34:54.120 line:0%
[Xiuxiu]

00:34:53.320 --> 00:34:54.310 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:34:55.280 --> 00:34:56.680 line:0%
What a beautiful name.

00:34:58.380 --> 00:34:59.180 line:0%
Xiuxiu...

00:35:01.730 --> 00:35:03.020 line:0%
But I know,

00:35:04.080 --> 00:35:04.840 line:0%
every time you call

00:35:04.840 --> 00:35:06.040 line:0%
her name,

00:35:07.980 --> 00:35:09.640 line:0%
it's so different.

00:35:11.640 --> 00:35:12.520 line:0%
I know

00:35:13.440 --> 00:35:14.480 line:0%
there's only

00:35:15.480 --> 00:35:16.320 line:0%
one thing

00:35:16.320 --> 00:35:17.760 line:0%
you've always wanted

00:35:19.600 --> 00:35:20.730 line:0%
in your heart,

00:35:21.040 --> 00:35:23.240 line:0%
and that is to bring Xiuxiu back to life.

00:35:36.390 --> 00:35:37.390 line:0%
Brother Mo.

00:35:39.520 --> 00:35:40.440 line:0%
I'll be gone.

00:35:45.070 --> 00:35:45.790 line:0%
Xiuxiu!

00:35:46.800 --> 00:35:47.570 line:0%
Xiuxiu.

00:35:48.680 --> 00:35:50.100 line:0%
Xiuxiu. Xiuxiu!

00:35:56.660 --> 00:35:57.760 line:0%
Brother Mo.

00:35:58.490 --> 00:36:00.190 line:0%
Xiuxiu is here.

00:36:08.990 --> 00:36:09.790 line:0%
Xiuxiu...

00:36:14.320 --> 00:36:16.000 line:0%
Why are you so foolish?

00:36:27.880 --> 00:36:28.820 line:0%
Du!

00:36:30.640 --> 00:36:32.120 line:0%
Have everyone else leave.

00:36:33.740 --> 00:36:34.560 line:0%
Come here.

00:36:35.280 --> 00:36:36.880 line:0%
I have something to tell you.

00:36:58.600 --> 00:36:59.520 line:0%
Du.

00:37:01.280 --> 00:37:04.280 line:0%
I heard you were released from the Prisoner's Center,

00:37:04.320 --> 00:37:05.240 line:0%
and I heard that you've become

00:37:05.240 --> 00:37:06.800 line:0%
the Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:37:06.800 --> 00:37:08.780 line:0%
I've also heard you've become cold-blooded and heartless,

00:37:08.780 --> 00:37:09.960 line:0%
cruel and vicious.

00:37:10.720 --> 00:37:12.520 line:0%
But I'm still glad.

00:37:14.600 --> 00:37:17.060 line:0%
You're the only survivor of the Shen family.

00:37:17.360 --> 00:37:20.200 line:0%
If you were still as gentle and easily bullied as before,

00:37:20.200 --> 00:37:21.800 line:0%
how could you avenge your father

00:37:21.800 --> 00:37:23.520 line:0%
and the entire Shen family?

00:37:25.960 --> 00:37:28.820 line:0%
After establishing the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:37:28.840 --> 00:37:30.840 line:0%
I've been investigating all along.

00:37:31.080 --> 00:37:31.880 line:0%
On the surface,

00:37:31.880 --> 00:37:33.360 line:0%
the evidence of the Shen family's case seems ironclad,

00:37:33.360 --> 00:37:34.420 line:0%
without any flaws.

00:37:34.560 --> 00:37:35.440 line:0%
But I still managed to find

00:37:35.440 --> 00:37:36.840 line:0%
some suspicious points.

00:37:37.880 --> 00:37:39.210 line:0%
What happened back then

00:37:40.900 --> 00:37:43.360 line:0%
couldn't have been done by one person alone.

00:37:46.390 --> 00:37:49.000 line:0%
My mentor, Shen Bingzhu, was naturally indifferent to worldly affairs.

00:37:49.000 --> 00:37:51.360 line:0%
He never wanted to get involved in court disputes.

00:37:51.360 --> 00:37:53.240 line:0%
He only cared about the common people.

00:37:53.240 --> 00:37:55.200 line:0%
No matter who was in what position,

00:37:55.200 --> 00:37:57.260 line:0%
he only did what he thought was right,

00:37:58.000 --> 00:38:00.680 line:0%
and all he wanted was for the people to be at peace.

00:38:00.680 --> 00:38:02.000 line:0%
But this very point

00:38:02.120 --> 00:38:04.250 line:0%
offended everyone else's interests.

00:38:04.280 --> 00:38:05.200 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager

00:38:05.200 --> 00:38:06.400 line:0%
you're so loyal to

00:38:06.920 --> 00:38:08.660 line:0%
wanted his submission.

00:38:08.920 --> 00:38:10.680 line:0%
Those who killed the entire Shen family

00:38:10.680 --> 00:38:11.880 line:0%
were the Zhou family.

00:38:16.000 --> 00:38:16.680 line:0%
I'll definitely uncover the truth

00:38:16.680 --> 00:38:18.410 line:0%
about what happened back then.

00:38:18.720 --> 00:38:20.280 line:0%
No matter how many years it takes,

00:38:20.280 --> 00:38:21.540 line:0%
and no matter who it is,

00:38:22.640 --> 00:38:23.520 line:0%
I will make them pay

00:38:23.520 --> 00:38:24.960 line:0%
one by one,

00:38:26.480 --> 00:38:27.610 line:0%
to comfort the souls

00:38:28.600 --> 00:38:31.860 line:0%
of the dozens of the Shen family members who died unjustly.

00:38:33.760 --> 00:38:34.560 line:0%
Du.

00:38:35.680 --> 00:38:37.230 line:0%
I never thought

00:38:37.310 --> 00:38:38.800 line:0%
that you and I would end up on opposite sides

00:38:38.800 --> 00:38:40.680 line:0%
because of the same hatred.

00:38:41.440 --> 00:38:42.760 line:0%
If you succeed one day,

00:38:42.840 --> 00:38:44.840 line:0%
remember to light an incense for me.

00:38:45.680 --> 00:38:47.210 line:0%
On my way to the underworld,

00:38:47.720 --> 00:38:49.520 line:0%
I can then rest in peace.

00:38:49.720 --> 00:38:50.520 line:0%
Senior.

00:38:51.360 --> 00:38:52.160 line:0%
Senior!

00:38:56.680 --> 00:38:59.040 line:0%
♫Grudges and debts, right and wrong♫

00:38:59.200 --> 00:39:01.190 line:0%
Behind Xiuxiu's painting,

00:38:59.790 --> 00:39:01.990 line:0%
♫The past is shrouded in blood and tears♫

00:39:01.650 --> 00:39:03.450 line:0%
there's something I want to give

00:39:03.020 --> 00:39:04.620 line:0%
♫It's been a long time since we parted♫

00:39:04.100 --> 00:39:05.360 line:0%
you...

00:39:05.630 --> 00:39:08.450 line:0%
♫Can't fully explain the true story♫

00:39:09.630 --> 00:39:11.750 line:0%
♫Fate twists and turns♫

00:39:12.070 --> 00:39:12.670 line:0%
Senior!

00:39:12.500 --> 00:39:14.680 line:0%
♫Life and death, fortune and misfortune, always intertwined♫

00:39:15.790 --> 00:39:17.370 line:0%
♫Obsession is hard to dispel, retain the true and discard the false♫

00:39:18.470 --> 00:39:20.090 line:0%
♫Let the wind blow♫

00:39:20.580 --> 00:39:24.000 line:0%
♫Through thick and thin, unwavering in heart♫

00:39:24.820 --> 00:39:26.790 line:0%
♫I'll be with you forever♫

00:39:27.260 --> 00:39:31.450 line:0%
♫At least I have you to share both joy and sorrow♫

00:39:33.260 --> 00:39:35.820 line:0%
♫Unravel fate, fearless and unyielding♫

00:39:36.850 --> 00:39:38.750 line:0%
♫A dream brings me back♫

00:39:39.250 --> 00:39:44.180 line:0%
♫The scenery is bright, hand in hand, we go back together♫

00:40:30.560 --> 00:40:31.680 line:0%
Ghost!

00:40:39.600 --> 00:40:41.520 line:0%
Karma has arrived. Karma has arrived!

00:40:41.520 --> 00:40:42.360 line:0%
As soon as Lord Mo passed away,

00:40:42.360 --> 00:40:43.800 line:0%
such a strange thing happened.

00:40:43.800 --> 00:40:45.330 line:0%
This is divine punishment!

00:40:52.650 --> 00:40:53.620 line:0%
It's poisoning.

00:40:54.520 --> 00:40:55.320 line:0%
Move aside.

00:40:59.480 --> 00:41:00.480 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:41:01.220 --> 00:41:02.200 line:0%
There have been multiple incidents

00:41:02.200 --> 00:41:03.690 line:0%
of such bizarre occurrences in the city.

00:41:03.690 --> 00:41:05.300 line:0%
It's absolutely horrifying.

00:41:05.300 --> 00:41:07.170 line:0%
Over 30 civilians have been affected.

00:41:07.170 --> 00:41:08.310 line:0%
If this continues,

00:41:09.360 --> 00:41:10.760 line:0%
I'm afraid chaos will ensue.

00:41:10.760 --> 00:41:12.340 line:0%
This is the work of the Fire Moth Sect.

00:41:12.340 --> 00:41:13.960 line:0%
If we can't find a solution,

00:41:13.960 --> 00:41:14.640 line:0%
won't

00:41:14.730 --> 00:41:16.590 line:0%
the Fire Moth Sect conquer Yingzhou City

00:41:16.590 --> 00:41:17.950 line:0%
with just this poison?

00:41:18.480 --> 00:41:20.540 line:0%
And without shedding a drop of blood?

00:41:22.810 --> 00:41:24.580 line:0%
Although the toxicity of this poison is strong,

00:41:24.580 --> 00:41:26.180 line:0%
it takes time to take effect.

00:41:26.200 --> 00:41:26.960 line:0%
They won't be in immediate

00:41:26.960 --> 00:41:28.210 line:0%
danger for now.

00:41:29.360 --> 00:41:30.320 line:0%
I'll find a way

00:41:30.320 --> 00:41:31.320 line:0%
to get the antidote as soon as possible.

00:41:31.320 --> 00:41:31.960 line:0%
Yes.

00:41:32.760 --> 00:41:34.160 line:0%
Take care of things here.

00:41:34.310 --> 00:41:34.910 line:0%
Yes.

00:41:46.420 --> 00:41:48.040 line:0%
Behind Xiuxiu's painting,

00:41:48.200 --> 00:41:51.560 line:0%
there's something I want to give you.